    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101749" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφῠδόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be in full health</i> or <i>vigour</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφυδῶν: εὔρωστος, ἰσχυρός, σκληρός</span>, <i><span class="en">
